{
 "about": "Hostile Markdown for renderMarkdown (ADR 0016, plan step 5.2). Every case is run through the renderer in Node (clients/desktop/tests/markdown.test.js), through the popup in Chromium (clients/desktop/tests/ui.test.js) and, as text, through the admin's views (tests/e2e/admin.test.js). Fields: name; input, or generate (repeat, indented_list); visible: substrings the output must contain; absent: substrings it must not; links: the addresses the output may link to (every link must be one of these, if given); max_ms: how long it may take (default 2000). Every case also has to pass the allowlist in lib.js.",
